 "description": "A record field holds the rows of a price list. Each member candidate names its record and is decided as the value of a field. A record with each required member admitted is admitted, also when an optional member has no value. A row without its code is RECORD_MEMBER_MISSING and rejected, and a row with two codes is RECORD_MEMBER_CONFLICT. Each value that passed, of a record that is not admitted, gets RECORD_NOT_ADMITTED. A member candidate with no record is RECORD_INVALID, and a candidate for the record field itself is FIELD_UNKNOWN. A required record field with no record that is not rejected is in coverage (#613).",
